id: flexible-flanker
name: Flexible Flanker
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You are skilled in surrounding an opponent and taking them down with your allies.
text: >
  Flexible Flanker: You are skilled in surrounding an opponent and taking them down with your allies.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: If an Ally is on a Square adjacent to an Opponent, increase all of your Strike and Wound Rolls made against that Opponent by 1(T).

---

[passive]
# (1) Against that Opponent alone - an Ally of yours, not Defeated, on a Square adjacent to them, as Brigand Combat's (chat.mjs
# flankerParts).
strike.flanking += 1(T);
wound.flanking += 1(T);
